uportal/programmes/union-training-assistance-programme" target="_blank">NTUC U Portal – Union Training Assistance Program (UTAP)</a></span></p>\r\n', SUBSTRING(t.value, LOCATE('<h2>Minimum Software/Hardware Requirement</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Software:</strong></p>\r\n<p>You can download and install the following software: Claude Pro (minimally require this subscription)</p>\r\n<p><strong>Hardware:</strong> Windows and Mac Laptops</p>\r\n<p>The Union Training Assistance Programme (UTAP) is a training benefit provided to NTUC Union Members with an objective of encouraging them to upgrade with skills training. It is provided to minimize the training cost. If you are a NTUC Union Member then you can get 50% funding (capped at $500 per year) under Union Training Assistance Programme (UTAP).</p>\r\n<p>For more information visit <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://www.ntuc.org.sg/uportal/programmes/union-training-assistance-programme" target="_blank">NTUC U Portal – Union Training Assistance Program (UTAP)</a></span></p>\r\n', t.value) + CHAR_LENGTH('<h2>Minimum Software/Hardware Requirement</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Software:</strong></p>\r\n<p>You can download and install the following software: Claude Pro (minimally require this subscription)</p>\r\n<p><strong>Hardware:</strong> Windows and Mac Laptops</p>\r\n<p>The Union Training Assistance Programme (UTAP) is a training benefit provided to NTUC Union Members with an objective of encouraging them to upgrade with skills training. It is provided to minimize the training cost. If you are a NTUC Union Member then you can get 50% funding (capped at $500 per year) under Union Training Assistance Programme (UTAP).</p>\r\n<p>For more information visit <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://www.ntuc.org.sg/uportal/programmes/union-training-assistance-programme" target="_blank">NTUC U Portal – Union Training Assistance Program (UTAP)</a></span></p>\r\n')))
